      "message": "Open bounded prime gaps for direct submissions (issue route)\n\nThe prime gaps smoke passed on 2026-11-06: run 42305726764, test issue #172, verifier 2d44726, fixture\nbigospeedrun/verifier-smoke-prime-gaps@abc6a6e (darkhipo/prime-gaps-246-lean@ac0eb01b under Submission/, imports\nrenamed only; smoke.PG_FIXTURE), bound 246. Final receipt passed: Lean (890 s, peak 6.6 GB) and nanoda (1211 s)\ncomparator_acceptance; axiom audit: Race.bound uses only propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound; generated challenge\n2f817e68; lean.log has no error line. Split run: build job 34 min, verify job 39 min. Its first run (42301733703 at\n18158dd) failed to build Architect/CollectUsed.lean with autoImplicit = false; 2d44726 gives LeanArchitect Lean's\ndefault.\n\nBefore it, the control and five statement mutations (same repository, proofs by sorry, smoke.PG_MUTATIONS) were all\nrefused as planned:\n- control 42292994745 (#166, 1b31b82, 246): \"Illegal axiom detected: 'sorryAx'\"; the statement matched\n- M1 42295113989 (#167, 1b31b82, offered as 245): \"Challenge and solution theorem statement do not match: 'Race.bound'\"\n- M2 42296539519 (#168, ff005c1, < for ≤), M3 42297912639 (#169, f707281, ∀ᶠ for ∃ᶠ), M4 42299387647 (#170, ce76e48,\n  m + 2), M5 42300560394 (#171, de38d4d, Prime for Nat.Prime): \"Const does not match between challenge and target\n  'BigOSpeedrun.PrimeGaps.Bound'\" (statement_mismatch, mismatch: definition)\n\n- CLOSED is now empty. The issue form offers prime-gaps (issue route only).\n- README: the problem list, the meaning (a whole number B with H₁ ≤ B; smaller is better; a fraction is refused),\n  the range 0 ≤ B ≤ 100000, and the split build. docs/targets.md and the statement README say the route is open;\n  docs/execution.md lists the runs.\n- Tests: prime gaps is open (the form option, the board line); the smoke and the other problems' form tests\n  follow. 303 OK, also with BOS_SPLIT=true.\n\nThe site half (prime-gaps profile, statement fixture, PROBLEMS, OTHER row form, submit line) must be on the site's\nmain branch before this commit is pushed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
